Oversubscription Governor

Copyright 2026 Summon Software Labs

Oversubscription Governor is an open-source, vendor-neutral C++20 runtime for
generation-bound governance of deliberate network oversubscription: contention
domains, guarantees, contingent demand, risk budgets, headroom, and bounded
corrective intent.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Oversubscription Governor does not collect or transmit any telemetry. Durable
state, audit history, and benchmark output are written only to paths chosen by
the operator on the machine running the software.

Oversubscription Governor accepts contributions from individuals and
organizations on the terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a
Contributor License Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution
guidance.
